<style>
  .panel-root { flex-direction: column; width: 56; padding-top: 1.8; padding-bottom: 1.8; padding-left: 2.2; padding-right: 2.2; background-color: #0a1019f2; border-color: #e0a62b; border-width: 0.12; border-radius: 0.8; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 0.9; font-weight: 700; color: #e0a62b; margin-bottom: 0.3; }
  .heading { font-size: 1.8; font-weight: 700; color: #f2f6fa; margin-bottom: 0.6; }
  .hint { font-size: 1; color: #b8a888; margin-bottom: 0.8; }
  .target { font-size: 1.2; color: #f2e8d8; margin-bottom: 0.6; }
  .stage-btn { width: 100%; height: 2.8; background-color: #a3741e; border-radius: 1.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #fff6e0; font-size: 1.2; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  .gloss { font-size: 0.85; color: #8a7a5a; margin-top: 0.4; margin-bottom: 0.4; }
  .preview-text { font-size: 1.05; color: #f2d8a8; margin-top: 0.8; margin-bottom: 0.8; }
  .commit-btn { width: 100%; height: 2.8; background-color: #b02e2e; border-radius: 1.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: white; font-size: 1.2; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.6; }
  .cancel-btn { width: 100%; height: 2.4; background-color: #1d2a3b; border-radius: 1.2; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #e8e8e8; font-size: 1.1; cursor: pointer; }
  .result-text { margin-top: 0.8; font-size: 1; color: #a8d8a8; }
</style>
<div class="panel-root" id="containment-root" style="display: none">
  <span class="eyebrow">INTERVENTION STATION - the one mutation path</span>
  <span class="heading">Quarantine an actor</span>
  <span class="hint" id="containment-hint">log in to commit; staging a preview needs no session</span>
  <span class="target" id="actor-row-label">target: pipeline-logs (ACTIVE)</span>
  <button class="stage-btn" id="stage-btn">Stage quarantine</button>
  <span class="gloss">preview only - nothing changes yet. Staged memories get an amber PREVIEW ring on the field.</span>
  <span class="preview-text" id="preview-text" style="display: none"></span>
  <button class="commit-btn" id="commit-btn" style="display: none">Commit (writes to MNEME)</button>
  <button class="cancel-btn" id="cancel-btn" style="display: none">Cancel</button>
  <span class="gloss" id="commit-gloss" style="display: none">Commit is the one action that actually changes the field</span>
  <span class="result-text" id="result-text"></span>
</div>
